Package: rzig
Type: Package
Title: Safe Zig Bindings for R Packages
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Marek", "Deja", email = "marekdejauj@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Scaffolds Zig-backed R packages and generates a safe native
    boundary for plain Zig functions. The generated integration handles R
    object conversion, native routine registration, error propagation, and
    cross-platform compilation without requiring C++.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/MarekDejaUJ/rzig
BugReports: https://github.com/MarekDejaUJ/rzig/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
SystemRequirements: Zig (>= 0.16.0), see https://ziglang.org/download/
NeedsCompilation: no
Suggests:
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
VignetteBuilder: knitr
